### Create user A

POST http://localhost:7070/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jwtTestA",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

###

### Create user B

POST http://localhost:7070/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jwtTestB",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

###

### Login with user A

POST http://localhost:7070/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jwtTestA",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

###

### Login with user B

POST http://localhost:7070/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jwtTestB",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

###

### Get users with user A's JWT

GET http://localhost:7070/api/users
Authorization: Bearer INDSÆT_BRUGER_A_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

###

### Get users with user B's JWT

GET http://localhost:7070/api/users
Authorization: Bearer INDSÆT_BRUGER_B_TOKEN
Accept: application/json

